\section{Frozen question and decision rule}
\textbf{Hypothesis.} \VAR{summary.hypothesis|latex}

The experiment was frozen before full-run metrics. The primary endpoint is
mean log-space RMSE at 15, 30, and 60 minutes; 5 minutes is a registered
anchor. Success requires at least 2\% improvement over persistence and the
stronger MLP/TCN control, positive paired 24-hour bootstrap intervals, the
same direction for all three seeds, 70--90\% interval coverage, and no
material bias, tail, CRPS, or stability regression.

