\section{Provenance, split, and leakage boundary}
The source is the public OTBench USNA-large surface record and the target is a
direct \cn{} observation \cite{otbench}. The broader short-timescale
optical-turbulence forecasting precedent motivates chronological rather than
random evaluation \cite{turchi2022optical}. Each fold fits preprocessing on
its training role, uncertainty handling on its calibration role, and
early-stopping on selection only. The three rolling periods cover different
weather seasons. No confirmation labels enter these runs.

