\section{Paired uncertainty and seed direction}
The bootstrap first averages squared errors across neural seeds at each exact
timestamp/horizon, then resamples 24-hour chronological blocks. Thus random
seeds are not counted as independent weather periods. It uses exactly 2,000
resamples and seed 20260730.

