this matrix.

\section{Limitations, verdict, and next cycle}
These results are from one site, capped training examples, three seasonal
development windows, and direct near-surface observations. They do not
establish operational readiness, transfer to another instrument, or causal
regimes. A point-estimate gain cannot override failed uncertainty, tail,
bootstrap, or seed-direction conditions.

\VAR{summary.plain_language_conclusion|latex}
If the rolling gate fails, the next preregistered development cycle changes
one factor: add a robust explicit persistence-residual point objective while
retaining the same probabilistic heads, split, controls, and thresholds. The
confirmation block stays sealed.

